                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<p>Longitudinal study with a representative sample of adult Dutch online users on the effects of social media use on various indicators of social capital and well-being. Social media use covers the use of Facebook or other platforms mainly used for private purposes, LinkedIn or other platforms used for professional purposes and Twitter or other microblogging services.</p>"
